{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":22,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2100,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1841166,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1396059282,"LastPoster":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":57,"Preview":{"Id":1841166,"PostDate":1396059282,"PostContent":"Any other May 2015 brides and\/or grooms? Let's share ideas and help each other! We are getting ma...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f56af0b48b70a2dff6d18f991ffc3cd7","RawContent":"Any other May 2015 brides and\/or grooms? Let&#039;s share ideas and help each other!\n\n\nWe are getting married May 30th at Now Jade.  We wanted May 2 but it was booked. I actually pouted for a day or two. Oh well...such is life.\n\n\nWhere are you with your planning?","Attachments":[],"Id":1841166,"PostDate":1396059282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Any other May 2015 brides and\/or grooms? Let's share ideas and help each other!<br><br>\nWe are getting married May 30th at Now Jade.  We wanted May 2 but it was booked. I actually pouted for a day or two. Oh well...such is life.<br><br>\nWhere are you with your planning?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43ea223696686543c3bd97971948654e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;*waves* May 27, 2015 wedding for us! We also wanted early May but my MOH\/sister has her licensing exam for becoming a practicing physician sometime during the beginning of May, so we\u2019ve had to avoid doing anything during that timeframe.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We\u2019re going to be doing a Hindu wedding ceremony in Jamaica, which is a whole another layer of complicated. We\u2019ve booked the resort (Royalton White Sands) but we still need to speak with the priest directly (there\u2019s only ONE Hindu priest who does weddings in all of Jamaica). We\u2019re also doing a small Catholic church wedding at home before the DW, so my planning is split between two places! But I\u2019m still having so much fun with it. :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842040,"PostDate":1396454876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>*waves* May 27, 2015 wedding for us! We also wanted early May but my MOH\/sister has her licensing exam for becoming a practicing physician sometime during the beginning of May, so we\u2019ve had to avoid doing anything during that timeframe.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We\u2019re going to be doing a Hindu wedding ceremony in Jamaica, which is a whole another layer of complicated. We\u2019ve booked the resort (Royalton White Sands) but we still need to speak with the priest directly (there\u2019s only ONE Hindu priest who does weddings in all of Jamaica). We\u2019re also doing a small Catholic church wedding at home before the DW, so my planning is split between two places! But I\u2019m still having so much fun with it. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389143480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.148.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a6771a4fda3a6ed96f09217c263703a","RawContent":"\n\nI&#039;m happy to see another May 2015 bride. You will be a busy bee with all your planning.  I&#039;m familiar with Hindu wedding ceremonies.\n\n\nWe are still up in the air in regards to an AHR. We&#039;re leaning towards using that $$$ towards buying a house. We&#039;ll see...","Attachments":[],"Id":1842048,"PostDate":1396456323,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br>\nI'm happy to see another May 2015 bride. You will be a busy bee with all your planning.  I'm familiar with Hindu wedding ceremonies.<br><br>\nWe are still up in the air in regards to an AHR. We're leaning towards using that $$$ towards buying a house. We'll see...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.179.102.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40ab5e5276b8c6129d935435746a2115","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey All!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am a May 2015 Bride. This is actually my second post! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations to you all!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843566,"PostDate":1397094715,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey All!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a May 2015 Bride. This is actually my second post! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations to you all!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nagrant84@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.179.102.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376793703,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272689.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MzDimplez915","Id":272689,"Name":"MzDimplez915","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cceea79edf8e0884fdea6cd4c9be6f46","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1841166\" timestamp=\"1396059282\"]\nAny other May 2015 brides and\/or grooms? Let&#039;s share ideas and help each other!\n\nWe are getting married May 30th at Now Jade. We wanted May 2 but it was booked. I actually pouted for a day or two. Oh well...such is life.\n\nWhere are you with your planning?\n\n[\/quote]Hey! I am getting married May 22 at the Now Jade. We are there for 12 days. When are you arriving!? I am really early in the planning. Trying dresses on for the first time May 3 and 10th","Attachments":[],"Id":1844756,"PostDate":1397680666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 28 March 2014 - 06:14 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Any other May 2015 brides and\/or grooms? Let's share ideas and help each other!<br><br>\nWe are getting married May 30th at Now Jade. We wanted May 2 but it was booked. I actually pouted for a day or two. Oh well...such is life.<br><br>\nWhere are you with your planning?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey! I am getting married May 22 at the Now Jade. We are there for 12 days. When are you arriving!? I am really early in the planning. Trying dresses on for the first time May 3 and 10th<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlynnmape@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389395170,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jayejayelynn","Id":275997,"Name":"jayejayelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdf40fffadd77a462424d54705747aa1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jayejayelynn\" post=\"1844756\" timestamp=\"1397680666\"]\nHey! I am getting married May 22 at the Now Jade. We are there for 12 days. When are you arriving!? I am really early in the planning. Trying dresses on for the first time May 3 and 10th[\/quote]\n\nAnother Now Jade bride! Yay!  We are arriving May 28th.  What locations are you using?  We are getting married at the Pergola...Mix Bar for cocktail hour...Carnival Terrace for our reception.\n\nI haven&#039;t even thought about a dress yet.  We are working on save the dates and securing all our deposits. After all that is done then I can focus on a dress...lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1844838,"PostDate":1397695306,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jayejayelynn, on 16 April 2014 - 12:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey! I am getting married May 22 at the Now Jade. We are there for 12 days. When are you arriving!? I am really early in the planning. Trying dresses on for the first time May 3 and 10th<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Another Now Jade bride! Yay! \u00a0We are arriving May 28th. \u00a0What locations are you using? \u00a0We are getting married at the Pergola...Mix Bar for cocktail hour...Carnival Terrace for our reception.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't even thought about a dress yet. \u00a0We are working on save the dates and securing all our deposits. After all that is done then I can focus on a dress...lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b11d98859de86326391ec426dd1100c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1844838\" timestamp=\"1397695306\"]\nAnother Now Jade bride! Yay!  We are arriving May 28th.  What locations are you using?  We are getting married at the Pergola...Mix Bar for cocktail hour...Carnival Terrace for our reception.\n\nI haven&#039;t even thought about a dress yet.  We are working on save the dates and securing all our deposits. After all that is done then I can focus on a dress...lol[\/quote]\nOur wedding is May 22, 2015. My Fiance and I will be there 2 weeks total! I think we actually leave on the 28th :(\n\nWe are also doing the same venues for our wedding! We only have 33 people so our travel coordinator here in Canada who also had her wedding there suggested those as the top ones she would pick! \n\nI have secured our deposit - I actually try dresses on May 3 and 10th!! I am a little nervous! haha\n\nI am starting to look at all the little details. We went with Eternity package because I want to be able to do a few things on my own and I didnt need eveything that was in the Divine package. what about you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1845576,"PostDate":1398190771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 16 April 2014 - 04:41 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Another Now Jade bride! Yay! \u00a0We are arriving May 28th. \u00a0What locations are you using? \u00a0We are getting married at the Pergola...Mix Bar for cocktail hour...Carnival Terrace for our reception.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't even thought about a dress yet. \u00a0We are working on save the dates and securing all our deposits. After all that is done then I can focus on a dress...lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our wedding is May 22, 2015. My Fiance and I will be there 2 weeks total! I think we actually leave on the 28th <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also doing the same venues for our wedding! We only have 33 people so our travel coordinator here in Canada who also had her wedding there suggested those as the top ones she would pick!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have secured our deposit - I actually try dresses on May 3 and 10th!! I am a little nervous! haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am starting to look at all the little details. We went with Eternity package because I want to be able to do a few things on my own and I didnt need eveything that was in the Divine package. what about you?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlynnmape@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389395170,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jayejayelynn","Id":275997,"Name":"jayejayelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be5ac888147c0125e5a5385da932353d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jayejayelynn\" post=\"1845576\" timestamp=\"1398190771\"]\nOur wedding is May 22, 2015. My Fiance and I will be there 2 weeks total! I think we actually leave on the 28th :(\n\nWe are also doing the same venues for our wedding! We only have 33 people so our travel coordinator here in Canada who also had her wedding there suggested those as the top ones she would pick! \n\nI have secured our deposit - I actually try dresses on May 3 and 10th!! I am a little nervous! haha\n\nI am starting to look at all the little details. We went with Eternity package because I want to be able to do a few things on my own and I didnt need eveything that was in the Divine package. what about you?[\/quote]\nOh no, you leave the day we arrive.\n\nWe went with the Eternity package as well.  Couldn&#039;t justify the cost for the larger package.  We are however upgrading our reception dinner option the one of the Devine options.  I have a quote from Isela for $5 per person...not bad at all.\n\nWhat type of invitations are you doing?  \n\nWe are preparing to send out Save the Dates within the next two weeks.  \n[quote name=\"MzDimplez915\" post=\"1843566\" timestamp=\"1397094715\"]\nHey All!\n\nI am a May 2015 Bride. This is actually my second post! :)\n\nCongratulations to you all![\/quote]\nWelcome and congratulations to you as well!\n\nWhere are you in your planning stage?","Attachments":[],"Id":1845579,"PostDate":1398191486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jayejayelynn, on 22 April 2014 - 10:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Our wedding is May 22, 2015. My Fiance and I will be there 2 weeks total! I think we actually leave on the 28th <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also doing the same venues for our wedding! We only have 33 people so our travel coordinator here in Canada who also had her wedding there suggested those as the top ones she would pick!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have secured our deposit - I actually try dresses on May 3 and 10th!! I am a little nervous! haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am starting to look at all the little details. We went with Eternity package because I want to be able to do a few things on my own and I didnt need eveything that was in the Divine package. what about you?\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh no, you leave the day we arrive.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We went with the Eternity package as well. \u00a0Couldn't justify the cost for the larger package. \u00a0We are however upgrading our reception dinner option the one of the Devine options. \u00a0I have a quote from Isela for $5 per person...not bad at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What type of invitations are you doing? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are preparing to send out Save the Dates within the next two weeks. \u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MzDimplez915, on 09 April 2014 - 05:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey All!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a May 2015 Bride. This is actually my second post! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations to you all!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome and congratulations to you as well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you in your planning stage?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef08836a5ca731d1d92b252bc6e48205","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1845579\" timestamp=\"1398191486\"]\nOh no, you leave the day we arrive.\n\nWe went with the Eternity package as well.  Couldn&#039;t justify the cost for the larger package.  We are however upgrading our reception dinner option the one of the Devine options.  I have a quote from Isela for $5 per person...not bad at all.\n\nWhat type of invitations are you doing?  \n\nWe are preparing to send out Save the Dates within the next two weeks.  \n\n\nWelcome and congratulations to you as well!\n\nWhere are you in your planning stage?[\/quote]\n\nWe are doing boarding pass invites and then passport book styles closer to the wedding with a detailed itinerary, info etc. My gf owns a scrapbook store so her gift to me is helping with these invites!!! such a relief!\n\nI was thinking about upgrading my menu also! $5 a person isnt bad at all! Did you get the planning document already or did you just email her? My travel coordinator already has been sending communications to my guests so I am not sending an official Save The Date... Seems pointless for me now since they are already putting deposits on their vacation haha.\n\nWhat kind of invites are you going to do?","Attachments":[],"Id":1845587,"PostDate":1398193064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 22 April 2014 - 10:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh no, you leave the day we arrive.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We went with the Eternity package as well. \u00a0Couldn't justify the cost for the larger package. \u00a0We are however upgrading our reception dinner option the one of the Devine options. \u00a0I have a quote from Isela for $5 per person...not bad at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What type of invitations are you doing? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are preparing to send out Save the Dates within the next two weeks. \u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome and congratulations to you as well!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you in your planning stage?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are doing boarding pass invites and then passport book styles closer to the wedding with a detailed itinerary, info etc. My gf owns a scrapbook store so her gift to me is helping with these invites!!! such a relief!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking about upgrading my menu also! $5 a person isnt bad at all! Did you get the planning document already or did you just email her? My travel coordinator already has been sending communications to my guests so I am not sending an official Save The Date... Seems pointless for me now since they are already putting deposits on their vacation haha.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What kind of invites are you going to do?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlynnmape@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389395170,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jayejayelynn","Id":275997,"Name":"jayejayelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d500b6f3a9585ae7a6c5b9defb6df055","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jayejayelynn\" post=\"1845587\" timestamp=\"1398193064\"]\nWe are doing boarding pass invites and then passport book styles closer to the wedding with a detailed itinerary, info etc. My gf owns a scrapbook store so her gift to me is helping with these invites!!! such a relief!\n\nI was thinking about upgrading my menu also! $5 a person isnt bad at all! Did you get the planning document already or did you just email her? My travel coordinator already has been sending communications to my guests so I am not sending an official Save The Date... Seems pointless for me now since they are already putting deposits on their vacation haha.\n\nWhat kind of invites are you going to do?[\/quote]\n\nI believe she sent the planning document to me already.  If my memory serves me correctly, she highlighted not to turn it in until 4 weeks before the wedding.  Do you need it?\n\nI see what you mean about STDs.  If you already have guest communicating with you TA there really is no need.  As for invitations, we are doing passports.  There was a bride on here a few years back who has since started a business doing passport invitations.  We will be using her. You are lucky to have a friend that can assist you with your invitations.  That&#039;s pretty awesome!","Attachments":[],"Id":1845637,"PostDate":1398207206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jayejayelynn, on 22 April 2014 - 10:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are doing boarding pass invites and then passport book styles closer to the wedding with a detailed itinerary, info etc. My gf owns a scrapbook store so her gift to me is helping with these invites!!! such a relief!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking about upgrading my menu also! $5 a person isnt bad at all! Did you get the planning document already or did you just email her? My travel coordinator already has been sending communications to my guests so I am not sending an official Save The Date... Seems pointless for me now since they are already putting deposits on their vacation haha.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What kind of invites are you going to do?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I believe she sent the planning document to me already. \u00a0If my memory serves me correctly, she highlighted not to turn it in until 4 weeks before the wedding. \u00a0Do you need it?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see what you mean about STDs. \u00a0If you already have guest communicating with you TA there really is no need. \u00a0As for invitations, we are doing passports. \u00a0There was a bride on here a few years back who has since started a business doing passport invitations. \u00a0We will be using her. You are lucky to have a friend that can assist you with your invitations. \u00a0That's pretty awesome!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76712","Title":"May 2015 Brides","LastPostDate":1427721887},"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
