Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6910ccb69784106e714aedae3125f9ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrat to you all....I am getting married May 8th, 2015 at the Riu Ocho Rios in Jamaica... As far as having it booked thats as far as I got dont know where else to start lol...what about you guys how far are you in your planning?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845698,"PostDate":1398255358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrat to you all....I am getting married May 8th, 2015 at the Riu Ocho Rios in Jamaica... As far as having it booked thats as far as I got dont know where else to start lol...what about you guys how far are you in your planning?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378745169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6aeb2355edda48ed4374928be7c45589","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kay2015\" post=\"1845698\" timestamp=\"1398255358\"]\nCongrat to you all....I am getting married May 8th, 2015 at the Riu Ocho Rios in Jamaica... As far as having it booked thats as far as I got dont know where else to start lol...what about you guys how far are you in your planning?[\/quote]\n\nWe have secured a date with the resort and a room block with the TA.  We are sending out Save The Date info next week.  I have also started picking up items for my OOT bags.","Attachments":[],"Id":1853794,"PostDate":1401892459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kay2015, on 23 April 2014 - 04:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrat to you all....I am getting married May 8th, 2015 at the Riu Ocho Rios in Jamaica... As far as having it booked thats as far as I got dont know where else to start lol...what about you guys how far are you in your planning?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have secured a date with the resort and a room block with the TA. \u00a0We are sending out Save The Date info next week. \u00a0I have also started picking up items for my OOT bags.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.15.8.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9b8927aad9817c7cd88e7d661c224bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! This is my very first post! Thought id say hi. I am a May 1st Bride @ the Now Jade. Cant wait! :) How much were the passport STD&#039;s.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873509,"PostDate":1411781547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! This is my very first post! Thought id say hi. I am a May 1st Bride @ the Now Jade. Cant wait! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> How much were the passport STD's.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>65 Guests + Bride and Groom!","Email":"yasminea84@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.15.8.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410281845,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279750.jpg?_r=1411781584","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yasminea84","Id":279750,"Name":"yasminea84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"109987dbe48a2e303e695d399dbdb6a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats everyone! Our wedding date is 5\/15\/15 at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya. Love seeing all these May 2015 brides!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874276,"PostDate":1412478552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats everyone! Our wedding date is 5\/15\/15 at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya. Love seeing all these May 2015 brides!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410923588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a469ce9f3068d44be3d289b357b33a32","RawContent":"[quote name=\"cfinkenbine\" post=\"1874276\" timestamp=\"1412478552\"]\nCongrats everyone! Our wedding date is 5\/15\/15 at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya. Love seeing all these May 2015 brides![\/quote]\nCool date! We wanted that date but there was no availability at our resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1874475,"PostDate":1412624617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cfinkenbine, on 04 October 2014 - 07:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrats everyone! Our wedding date is 5\/15\/15 at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya. Love seeing all these May 2015 brides!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cool date! We wanted that date but there was no availability at our resort.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.157.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a95d7f86b5899bb594f9f8591a3521bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;May 21, 2015 also at the Barcelo in Rivieria Maya! Can&#039;t come soon enough!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874479,"PostDate":1412625271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>May 21, 2015 also at the Barcelo in Rivieria Maya! Can't come soon enough!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412130898,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"829ae27c0fa61c739edc556933c9e38b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did anyone send out \"Thank You For Booking\" gifts\/cards? &amp;nbsp;I want to do a little something for guests after they book but I can&#039;t think of anything that won&#039;t be cheesy. &amp;nbsp;Any suggestions?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874480,"PostDate":1412625522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did anyone send out \"Thank You For Booking\" gifts\/cards? \u00a0I want to do a little something for guests after they book but I can't think of anything that won't be cheesy. \u00a0Any suggestions?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"469ee1559f753a61cd6b7330dfe6746f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We haven&#039;t sent a thank you for booking, but perhaps we will put that in our invite pocketfold. &amp;nbsp;We are still sending proper invites so trying to limit all thats sent!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875853,"PostDate":1413433043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We haven't sent a thank you for booking, but perhaps we will put that in our invite pocketfold. \u00a0We are still sending proper invites so trying to limit all thats sent!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412130898,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"330f1876071bf768cb7d8b0584e84e41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How are your plans coming along? &amp;nbsp;We have 30 people booked and we&#039;ve only sent out STDs. &amp;nbsp;What about you? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone started on their OOT bags?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882916,"PostDate":1421274472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How are your plans coming along? \u00a0We have 30 people booked and we've only sent out STDs. \u00a0What about you? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone started on their OOT bags?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.245.192.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76712,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b486facee79669d81271f9cda0d82ca9","RawContent":"Hey Everyone ... I just joined and this is the most amazing site I wish I had discovered it before we even booked our resort ... The ladies on here are absolutely amazing. \n\n\nI&#039;m getting married 5\/5\/15 at the Hard Rock Vallarta.\n\n\nThis site is helping the stress to pass and the excitement to build haha\n\n\nI can&#039;t wait till after my wedding so I can post helpful tips for other brides once I have fully gone through the process.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886104,"PostDate":1423694658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Everyone ... I just joined and this is the most amazing site I wish I had discovered it before we even booked our resort ... The ladies on here are absolutely amazing. <br><br>\nI'm getting married 5\/5\/15 at the Hard Rock Vallarta.<br><br>\nThis site is helping the stress to pass and the excitement to build haha<br><br>\nI can't wait till after my wedding so I can post helpful tips for other brides once I have fully gone through the process. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\n\u00a0","Email":"keegan.steele@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.134.151.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423289759,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
