}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.36.109","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78968,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Meandhim, 22 March 2015 - 12:42 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1427056974,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c84812570cc88cac609d060014de4cc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I Found the perfect shoe for my reception and I spent the entire day today going from payless to payless searching for this shoe.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.payless.com\/womens-chelsea-flat\/68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitter#start=10\" alt=\"68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitt\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Not one had my size in stock :( Anyone have suggestions for a shoe that looks like this....I like that the gold is lighter and it&#039;s glittery. or if anyone in the GTA area of Ontario happens to spot a pair please let me know!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t think picture I posted is working but here is the link &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/65583738299976584\/&#039;&gt;Gold Glitter Flats&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890363,"PostDate":1427056907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I Found the perfect shoe for my reception and I spent the entire day today going from payless to payless searching for this shoe.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.payless.com\/womens-chelsea-flat\/68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitter#start=10\" alt=\"68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitt\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not one had my size in stock <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> Anyone have suggestions for a shoe that looks like this....I like that the gold is lighter and it's glittery. or if anyone in the GTA area of Ontario happens to spot a pair please let me know!<\/p>\n<br><p>I don't think picture I posted is working but here is the link <a href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/65583738299976584\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Gold Glitter Flats<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1365792059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78968,"EditedBy":"",