             <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well...it looks like they are in stock at the Payless by my office...in Chicago. It is a completely random solution, but my fiance is going to Toronto for his \"non-bachelor party\" bachelor party at the end of April. I could send them with him and you could pick them up from where he is staying??<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.9.77.196","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78968,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71741fbbca28a6b3787fe3ee0a89e598","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Meandhim\" post=\"1890363\" timestamp=\"1427056907\"]\nSo I Found the perfect shoe for my reception and I spent the entire day today going from payless to payless searching for this shoe.\n\n[img]http:\/\/www.payless.com\/womens-chelsea-flat\/68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitter#start=10[\/img]\n\nNot one had my size in stock :( Anyone have suggestions for a shoe that looks like this....I like that the gold is lighter and it&#039;s glittery. or if anyone in the GTA area of Ontario happens to spot a pair please let me know!\n\nI don&#039;t think picture I posted is working but here is the link [url=\"https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/65583738299976584\/\"]Gold Glitter Flats[\/url][\/quote]I have those same exact pair of shoes in gold. I can check my local Payless stores if you like. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1890950,"PostDate":1427421260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Meandhim, on 22 March 2015 - 12:41 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So I Found the perfect shoe for my reception and I spent the entire day today going from payless to payless searching for this shoe.<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.payless.com\/womens-chelsea-flat\/68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitter#start=10\" alt=\"68790.html?dwvar_68790_color=silverglitt\"><\/span><br><br>\nNot one had my size in stock <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> Anyone have suggestions for a shoe that looks like this....I like that the gold is lighter and it's glittery. or if anyone in the GTA area of Ontario happens to spot a pair please let me know!<br><br>\nI don't think picture I posted is working but here is the link <a href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/pin\/65583738299976584\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Gold Glitter Flats<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI have those same exact pair of shoes in gold. I can check my local Payless stores if you like. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.36.109","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78968,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Meandhim, 26 March 2015 - 06:19 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1427422784,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bebcaadf4c6024c3cc038d04f92ad43","RawContent":"Thanks! @[member=\"hellosassypants\"]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890953,"PostDate":1427422581,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280004\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url f