he kind offer! that is SO nice! I will PM you when I get home from work tonight.","Attachments":[],"Id":1891713,"PostDate":1428004820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 26 March 2015 - 01:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Well...it looks like they are in stock at the Payless by my office...in Chicago. It is a completely random solution, but my fiance is going to Toronto for his \"non-bachelor party\" bachelor party at the end of April. I could send them with him and you could pick them up from where he is staying??<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0I'm just seeing this right now! I don't know how I missed it!!! Thank you for the kind offer! that is SO nice! I will PM you when I get home from work tonight.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1365792059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl